Article 4 (Ranks of Stationed Military Attaches)
Stationed military attaches shall hold the rank of lieutenant colonel or higher: Provided, That where two or more stationed military attaches are assigned to the same diplomatic mission abroad, their ranks shall be as follows: <Amended on July 4, 2018.>
1. Senior military attache under Article 6 (1) of the Decree (hereinafter referred to as a "senior military attache"): Lieutenant colonel or higher;
2. Military affairs officer under Article 6 (2) of the Decree: Lieutenant colonel or higher;
3. Assistant military attache under Article 6 (2) of the Decree: Lieutenant colonel or lower.
